   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SNV-GBA 2002</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SNV-GBA 2002</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;let med SNV:s projekt &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka demokratiseringsprocessen i G-B, genom att bl a h&#xf6;ja medvetandet om m&#xf6;jligheter till deltagande i det politiska systemet, sprida kunskap och information om m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, politiska partiers roll mm.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the SNV project is strengthening the democratic process in Guinea-Bissau, through, i.a. increase awareness about democratic opportunities, provide knowledge and information on human rights, about the role of political parties, and the possibilities within the political system to participate in  decision-making</narrative>
  </description>
